{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The schools have fallen, and the northern mafia now rules the town. Your students were defeated, your dojo destroyed \u2014 but your honor still stands. Rebuild your strength, train new fighters, and prepare for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/8b19824ac9b59044f68e88e935104822.poster.avif?t=1760971400\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/8b19824ac9b59044f68e88e935104822.webm?t=1760971400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/8b19824ac9b59044f68e88e935104822.mp4?t=1760971400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1\u00a0<strong>Faster and Masked Fighters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are faster, tougher, and loyal to their mafia boss. Each one hides behind a terrifying mask, striking with precision and aggression. They move swiftly and are harder to defeat \u2014 don\u2019t underestimate their speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfeb <strong>Repair Your School and Bring Back Your Students!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your dojo from the ashes and restore its former glory. Repair training areas, unlock new equipment, and call back your fallen students to train once more. Your school\u2019s revival begins with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/5216e2b7de7b2acfa9b2063fe3afdf0e.poster.avif?t=1760971400\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/5216e2b7de7b2acfa9b2063fe3afdf0e.webm?t=1760971400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/5216e2b7de7b2acfa9b2063fe3afdf0e.mp4?t=1760971400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>The Master\u2019s Sword</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your master entrusts you with his legendary katana \u2014 a weapon of pure honor and power. It can deal devastating damage to your enemies, but its weight slows your movements. Use it wisely\u2026 a true warrior knows when to strike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80\u00a0<strong>The Ruthless Mafia Leader</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He sits upon his throne deep inside the cave, ruling his empire of fear. With a massive spiked mace in hand, he controls all schools through tribute and violence. Be warned \u2014 his crushing blows <strong>cannot be blocked.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/764ae84b925f45f1516f6192365b4ae5.poster.avif?t=1760971400\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/764ae84b925f45f1516f6192365b4ae5.webm?t=1760971400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789800?t=1760971400","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789800?t=1760971400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/e126773831f22701b17d473320a78630b08ae610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760971400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/e126773831f22701b17d473320a78630b08ae610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760971400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The schools have fallen, and the northern mafia now rules the town. Your students were defeated, your dojo destroyed \u2014 but your honor still stands. Rebuild your strength, train new fighters, and prepare for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/8b19824ac9b59044f68e88e935104822.poster.avif?t=1760971400\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/8b19824ac9b59044f68e88e935104822.webm?t=1760971400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/8b19824ac9b59044f68e88e935104822.mp4?t=1760971400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1\u00a0<strong>Faster and Masked Fighters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are faster, tougher, and loyal to their mafia boss. Each one hides behind a terrifying mask, striking with precision and aggression. They move swiftly and are harder to defeat \u2014 don\u2019t underestimate their speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfeb <strong>Repair Your School and Bring Back Your Students!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your dojo from the ashes and restore its former glory. Repair training areas, unlock new equipment, and call back your fallen students to train once more. Your school\u2019s revival begins with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/5216e2b7de7b2acfa9b2063fe3afdf0e.poster.avif?t=1760971400\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/5216e2b7de7b2acfa9b2063fe3afdf0e.webm?t=1760971400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/5216e2b7de7b2acfa9b2063fe3afdf0e.mp4?t=1760971400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>The Master\u2019s Sword</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your master entrusts you with his legendary katana \u2014 a weapon of pure honor and power. It can deal devastating damage to your enemies, but its weight slows your movements. Use it wisely\u2026 a true warrior knows when to strike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80\u00a0<strong>The Ruthless Mafia Leader</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He sits upon his throne deep inside the cave, ruling his empire of fear. With a massive spiked mace in hand, he controls all schools through tribute and violence. Be warned \u2014 his crushing blows <strong>cannot be blocked.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/764ae84b925f45f1516f6192365b4ae5.poster.avif?t=1760971400\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789800/extras/764ae84b925f45f1516f6192365b4ae5.webm?t=1760971400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Queen Developer"],"fullgame":{"app